# CODEOWNERS for d15-b2b-platform
#
# Order matters: the LAST matching pattern wins for a given file.
# Patterns follow gitignore syntax.
#
# Every PR will auto-request review from the listed owners for files they own.
# When "Require review from Code Owners" is enabled in branch protection,
# changes to owned files require approval from the owner.

# Default owner — catches everything not matched below
*                                   @ariscaga

# Database & migrations — security-critical, never bypass review
/supabase/migrations/               @ariscaga
/supabase/functions/                @ariscaga

# RLS policies and auth — most sensitive code in the repo
**/rls/                             @ariscaga
**/auth/                            @ariscaga

# Billing & Stripe — financial logic
**/billing/                         @ariscaga
**/stripe/                          @ariscaga

# Demo session token logic — public-facing attack surface
**/demo/                            @ariscaga

# CI/CD and infrastructure config
/.github/                           @ariscaga
/vercel.json                        @ariscaga
/supabase/config.toml               @ariscaga